      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-69135",
      ":question/problem": "John has an overdraft facility authorized by his bank. His bank balance at the beginning of the month is $- $720.90$.\n\nJohn's salary was paid into his bank account midway through the month. When John received his money, his debt to the bank was reduced to one-third of the starting balance. Then, at the end of the month, John decided to withdraw $$150.20$ to buy a bicycle.\n\nWhat is John's bank balance after buying the bicycle?"
